<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">On the Edge of Time and Space</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;What do you do when life keeps coming at you? When everyday brings a new punch to the face? Do you let it drag you down? When you fall do you stay down or do you get back up? &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Steve has taken many hits over the course of his life. Some were easy to rise above. Others took him some time to pull himself together. But one thing remained the same. Steve would not give up on his friends, his home and his family.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ahead of him loomed the biggest battle of his life. One that would change the future of the whole universe. The balance rests on the edge of these moments, where battles are fought, trust and faith are ripped apart and reformed, secrets come out and Steve and his fond family figure out who they are. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I present to you On the Edge of Time and Space a Marvel SheRa crossover.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Aquatigermice, Call_Me_Kayyyyy (Cheeky9274)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
